# One batch died with `CFI failure (target: 0x0)` in a timer callback ~3 s after its modules
# registered (2026-10-16); apsys-dvfs is first because its own probe said
# "No matching driver data found", which is exactly how a driver ends up with an unarmed
# callback. Batches are single modules where a single module can be blamed.
